Obligatory Spoiler Warning:


The key to the trick you describe is to get up the stairs to the next level
_before_ the potion of paralysis wears off.  Once the Wiz is on an "inactive"
level, the game stops updating his paralysis counter, so he remains paralyzed
for the rest of the game (as long as you don't go back to that level again).

At least, this has worked for me.  (That was a helluva game.  If only I'd
remembered that I wasn't wearing my gloves...)

